WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.160 --> 00:00:02.600
Dearest queen,

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:08.020
You are mad. Giving me a palace; It is a monstrous extravagance.

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:09.300
Mrs. Molly, we are at war.

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:10.940
We won.

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:12.429
Oh it is not over. You must continue.

00:00:13.009 --> 00:00:14.450
Oh!

00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:16.000
Oh, I did not know that.

00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:18.820
The queen is an extraordinary person.

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:24.700
They were all staring weren't they? I can tell even if I can't see, and I heard the word fat. Fat.

00:00:24.980 --> 00:00:26.390
And ugly.

00:00:26.390 --> 00:00:28.700
No one but me would dare and I did not.

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:30.543
She's been stalked by tragedy.

00:00:30.543 --> 00:00:31.300
Everyone leaves me.

00:00:31.939 --> 00:00:32.800
He dies.

00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:33.939
Aaahh!

00:00:39.109 --> 00:00:42.940
I apologize for my appearance. I hoped I might be employed here, by you,

00:00:42.940 --> 00:00:43.820
as something.

00:00:43.820 --> 00:00:46.300
A monster for the children to play with, perhaps.

00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:47.400
Grrrr!

00:00:49.219 --> 00:00:52.675
It is important to make new friends in court, is it not?

00:00:52.675 --> 00:00:53.800
You're so beautiful.

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:56.800
Stop it oh. You mock me.

00:00:56.800 --> 00:00:58.359
If I were a man, I would ravish you.

00:00:59.149 --> 00:01:02.600
You have become close to Abigail. She is a viper.

00:01:02.900 --> 00:01:04.100
You're jealous

00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:04.900
You'll send abigail away.

00:01:04.900 --> 00:01:05.600
I do not want to.

00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:07.800
Let's shoot something.

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:08.300
(gunshot)

00:01:08.300 --> 00:01:08.800
Oh!

00:01:10.850 --> 00:01:14.100
Sometimes it is hard to remember whether you have loaded the pellet or not

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:17.400
I must take control of my circumstance.

00:01:17.400 --> 00:01:18.200
Throw.

00:01:18.200 --> 00:01:21.200
I'm on my side. (gunshot)

00:01:21.300 --> 00:01:22.850
Always.

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:28.800
Favor is a breeze that shifts direction all the time. Then in an instant, you're back sleeping with a bunch of scabrous whores

00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:31.900
As it turns out, I'm capable of much unpleasantness.

00:01:34.900 --> 00:01:36.700
Good use, look at me. Look at me!

00:01:37.400 --> 00:01:39.500
How dare you! Close your eyes!

00:01:41.369 --> 00:01:43.589
I could not just stand by and let you destroy me.

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:47.820
You are enjoying all of this, aren't you?

00:01:48.039 --> 00:01:50.588
Oh it is fun to be queen sometimes.

00:01:50.588 --> 00:01:55.029
If you do not go I will start kicking you, and I will not stop.

00:01:56.780 --> 00:01:59.928
My dear friend, how good to see you've returned from-

00:01:59.928 --> 00:02:03.900
hell. I'm sure you shall pass through it one day.

00:02:03.900 --> 00:02:04.400
(scoffs)

